      "exit": 0
     }
    },
    {
     "assistant": "An IIR tail decays into denormal floats; denormal arithmetic takes roughly 100 cycles per op on x86. Setting flush-to-zero and denormals-are-zero at engine init with _MM_SET_FLUSH_ZERO_MODE and _MM_SET_DENORMALS_ZERO_MODE."
    },
    {
     "tool": {
